  "description": "<p>Show your American spirit with our Veteran Flag T-Shirt! This patriotic shirt features a bold vertical American flag with &ldquo;Veteran&rdquo; lettering running down the front and a reversed US Flag on the right sleeve. Reliable and Long-Lasting: The soft, yet durable cotton / polyester fabric blend easily withstands strenuous activities. For added resilience, these graphic t-shirts feature a ribbed collar, tag-less neck label, and reinforced seams at the sleeves and bottom hem. Standard Fit: The short sleeve t-shirt is designed with a standard fit, giving you room and flexibility for any activity. The crew neck shirt sits approximately at the waist for full coverage and comfort. Land of the Free: These American flag t-shirts are ideal for holidays like Veteran's Day, Memorial Day, and 4th of July, and are great for going to the gym or everyday wear. We&rsquo;ve Got You Covered: Pair your patriotic tee with one of our Tactical BDU Cargo Pants or Vintage Paratrooper Cargo Shorts.</p>",
